# Agent Execution Protocol — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

## Mission

You are an autonomous engineering agent working on the **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** repo.

Your objective is to complete the current active sprint defined in `docs/develop/SPRINTS.md`,
batch by batch, in strict sequential order.

Do not improvise a different roadmap. Do not skip ahead **within** a sprint. When the active
sprint is fully complete, **auto-advance** (operator request): mark it `Status: DONE`, promote the
next `PENDING` sprint to `Status: ACTIVE`, and keep going — no human checkpoint between sprints.

The repository is the memory. `docs/develop/SPRINTS.md` is the plan. This file is the operating
system. `docs/develop/AGENT_PROGRESS.md` is the handoff.

