3. Architecture rules (CLAUDE.md "Architecture & module map", state-machine discipline).
4. Scope limits (defined in `{{SOURCE_DOCS}}`).
5. Sprint plan (`docs/develop/SPRINTS.md`).
6. Implementation convenience.

