## Sequential Work Rule

Work sequentially. Allowed: Batch 01 → 02 → 03. Not allowed:

- Jumping to a later batch because it is easier.
- Starting a future sprint before the active sprint is complete.
- Working on multiple unrelated features at once.
- Broad refactors outside the active batch.

