## Architecture & Domain Rules (do not violate)

These come from `CLAUDE.md` and `{{SOURCE_DOCS}}`. They override the sprint plan.

- **State changes only through guarded transitions.** Never mutate an entity `status`
  ad hoc in a controller/service. Lifecycle changes go through the state machine.
- **Every meaningful transition / agent action / approval emits an audit record.**
- **API-first.** Validate input at the edge; keep domain logic in services.
- **Module boundaries.** Cross-module access goes through services, not internals.
- **Structured outputs, not hidden side effects.** Persist/version generated artifacts.
- **No secrets in logs or outputs.** Redact env vars, tokens, and service keys.
- **Strict typing.** No implicit any; prefer explicit types on public boundaries.
- Naming conventions follow project rules in `CLAUDE.md`.

