## Commit Rule

Commit after each completed batch. Format:

```text
feat(sprint-<n>): complete batch <n> - <short name>
```

Also valid: `test(...)`, `docs(...)`, `fix(...)`, `chore(...)`. For unfinished but useful
progress: `wip(sprint-<n>): progress on batch <n> - <short name>`.

End commit messages with:

```text
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
```

Never commit broken work as complete.

